tsu — restyle a video\n1. Load a 4–30 s video.\n2. Right-click the Genjutsu node → **Pick Restyle style…** (required).\n3. Optionally connect character images to restyle specific people.\n\n**Cost safety**\n1. Press **Run** with **run = estimate only** — the node shows the exact price (free).\n2. Set **run = generate** to create it. **max cost (USD)** blocks anything above the limit.\n\nAPI key: *Settings → Higgsfield → API key*."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### Genjutsu — restyle a video\n1. Load a 4–30 s video.\n2. Right-click the Genjutsu node → **Pick Restyle style…** (required).\n3. Optionally connect character images to restyle specific people.\n\n**Cost safety**\n1. Press **Run** with **run = estimate only** — the node shows the exact price (free).\n2. Set **run = generate** to create it. **max cost (USD)** blocks anything above the limit.\n\nAPI key: *Settings → Higgsfield → API key*."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,2,"VIDEO"],[2,2,0,3,0,"VIDEO"],[3,2,2,4,0,"STRING"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1,"offset":[0,0]}},"version":0.4}